    {
      "id": "ydyp",
      "name": "移动云盘签到",
      "author": "@Feng",
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jy0703/scripts/main/scripts/ydyp.js",
      "descs_html": [
        "移动云盘自动签到 v5.0.9：每日签到/戳一戳、云朵中心新版任务(上传/分享/AI相机/云笔记/开启通知)、算力大作战、红包派对、139邮箱任务，支持多账号",
        "抓取：开启插件的捕获开关后打开移动云盘 App 首页即可（命中 user-njs.yun.139.com/user/ 的 Authorization，手机号从 Basic 认证里自动解析），抓完记得关闭开关",
        "ydyp_data 为 JSON 数组：[{\"Authorization\":\"Basic xxx\",\"phone\":\"138xxxxxxxx\",\"deviceId\":\"\"}]；deviceId 不参与抓取，可选，需抓 m.mcloud.139.com/ycloud/signin/page/startSignIn 的 deviceId 参数填入 ydyp_device_id 或账号项，留空时脚本自动生成",
        "Authorization 由脚本按有效期自动刷新(AES-ECB 调 refreshToken)，刷新结果与 deviceId 缓存在 ydyp_cache，无需手动维护；CK 彻底失效时通知会列出失效账号",
        "算力大作战好友助力默认邀请码已在脚本内，按需在 TOKENPK_INVITE_CODE 修改"
      ],
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jy0703/scripts/main/icons/ydyp.png",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jy0703/scripts/main/icons/ydyp.png"
      ],
      "keys": [
        "ydyp_data",
        "ydyp_device_id",
        "ydyp_cache"
      ],
      "settings": [
